  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>The MillénairePack</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">Это облегчённый модпак для версии 1.12.2, практически полностью сфокусированный на моде Millénaire. Он создан с целью (пере)изучения мода Millénaire в версии 1.12.2 при помощи нескольких вспомогательных утилит, которые дополняют основной мод и улучшают игровой процесс. Мод Millénaire вращается вокруг нового типа NPC-жителей, которым игрок может помогать и с которыми проживать. Данный модпак улучшает впечатления за счёт использования множества других модов и соответствующих настроек конфигурации.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<strong>Планы на будущее</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">Новый логотип модпака</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">Изменения в конфигурационных файлах</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">Улучшенное кастомное главное меню</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">Улучшенный пользовательский фон</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Список модов</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/mc-mods/270871\" rel=\"nofollow\">Millénaire (by Kinniken)</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/mc-mods/32274\" rel=\"nofollow\">JourneyMap (by techbrew)</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/mc-mods/226406\" rel=\"nofollow\">Custom Main Menu (by lumien231)</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/mc-mods/226447\" rel=\"nofollow\">Resource Loader (by lumien231)</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/mc-mods/238222\" rel=\"nofollow\">Just Enough Items (JEI) (by mezz)</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/mc-mods/223094\" rel=\"nofollow\">Inventory Tweaks (by Kobata)</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/mc-mods/265917\" rel=\"nofollow\">JEI Integration (by SnowShock35)</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/mc-mods/244181\" rel=\"nofollow\">Block Drops (JEI Addon) (by MrRiegel)</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/mc-mods/60089\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mouse Tweaks (by YaLTeR97)</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/mc-mods/237167\" rel=\"nofollow\">FTBLib (by FTB)</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/mc-mods/237102\" rel=\"nofollow\">FTB Utilities (by FTB)</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/mc-mods/238551\" rel=\"nofollow\">GraveStone Mod (by EuhDawson)</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/mc-mods/227441\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fullscreen Windowed (Borderless) for Minecraft (by hancin)</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/mc-mods/264353\" rel=\"nofollow\">SwingThroughGrass (by exidex)</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/mc-mods/245211\" rel=\"nofollow\">The One Probe (by McJty)</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/mc-mods/247111\" rel=\"nofollow\">TOP Addons (by DrManganese)</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/mc-mods/231275\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ding (by iChun)</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/mc-mods/242818\" rel=\"nofollow\">CodeChicken Lib 1.8.+ (by covers1624)</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/mc-mods/229061\" rel=\"nofollow\">Back Tools (by iChun)</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/mc-mods/240633\" rel=\"nofollow\">Inventory Sorter (by cpw11)</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/mc-mods/254268\" rel=\"nofollow\">TorchMaster (by xalcon)</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/mc-mods/225658\" rel=\"nofollow\">AromaBackup (by Aroma1997)</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/mc-mods/223275\" rel=\"nofollow\">BetterBedrockGen (by Gigabit1011)</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/mc-mods/236484\" rel=\"nofollow\">Chunk Animator (by lumien231)</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/mc-mods/223735\" rel=\"nofollow\">Aroma1997Core (by Aroma1997)</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/mc-mods/255902\" rel=\"nofollow\">Wither Skeleton Tweaks (by Shadows_of_Fire)</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/mc-mods/242568\" rel=\"nofollow\">Clay Bucket (by abecderic)</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/mc-mods/60092\" rel=\"nofollow\">Aroma1997s Dimensional World (by Aroma1997)</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/mc-mods/229073\" rel=\"nofollow\">Hats (by iChun)</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/mc-mods/226035\" rel=\"nofollow\">NoNausea (by lumien231)</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/mc-mods/263905\" rel=\"nofollow\">Lapis Stays in the Enchanting Table (by csb987)</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/mc-mods/243883\" rel=\"nofollow\">Chicken Chunks 1.8.+ (by covers1624)</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/mc-mods/261251\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bad Wither No Cookie - Reloaded (by kreezxil)</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center